Internet speed test for OPNsense, a hardened fork of the
os-speedtest-community plugin by Miha Kralj.

Runs the Ookla speedtest binary from the firewall, on a
schedule or on demand, from a chosen interface on multi-WAN
setups. Keeps a history with retention under /var/db, shows
averages and the latest result on the dashboard, and exports
the history as CSV. The binary is downloaded from Ookla at
install and checked against a pinned SHA-256; tests run only
after Ookla's terms are accepted in the settings.

WWW: https://github.com/SurfHost/opnsense-plugin-speedtest
